# RESTLESS: hidden spots, touched, give each half's rewards in their order
# (the first in the Greenwood Gate: three coins). Blink the owlet flies to
# the nearest one and blinks. Hidden spots per half: 2, 4, 3, 4, 3, 2.
game restless
wait 5
cheat half 0
cheat nospawn
cheat notimer
cheat god
expect secrets == 2
cheat owl
cheat pos 1000 144
wait 30
expect owl_target >= 0
cheat goto_secret 0
wait 2
expect secrets_found == 1
expect items_4 == 3
cheat half 1
expect secrets == 4
cheat half 2
expect secrets == 3
cheat half 3
expect secrets == 4
cheat half 4
expect secrets == 3
cheat half 5
expect secrets == 2
